_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/extras/23fec1bd2b77366e6f89c5f12bb70315.poster.avif?t=1756490723\" width=792 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/extras/23fec1bd2b77366e6f89c5f12bb70315.webm?t=1756490723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/extras/23fec1bd2b77366e6f89c5f12bb70315.mp4?t=1756490723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize and Upgrade Cars for Maximum Performance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a <strong>professional paint booth</strong> to create stunning designs. Modify vehicles with <strong>body kits, performance parts, and custom wraps</strong>. Improve speed, handling, and aesthetics to meet customer demands and build a reputation for top-quality work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/extras/36ebb56f334d85bce84c39978f719293.poster.avif?t=1756490723\" width=792 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/extras/36ebb56f334d85bce84c39978f719293.webm?t=1756490723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062150/extras/36ebb56f334d85bce84c39978f719293.mp4?t=1756490723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage and Expand Your Auto Service Business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Negotiate with customers, set competitive prices, and invest in better equipment. <strong>Buy, sell, and trade parts</strong> to maximize profits. A well-managed business means <strong>more customers, higher earnings, and a thriving workshop</strong>.</p><p cl